<li>Intercom, Zendesk, Dropbox, GitLab, and more (embed)</li>
<li>Salesforce (Beta)</li>
<li>Zoom Import</li>
</ul></div></div></details></div></div></div></div></div><!--/$--></section><section class="lg:px-fluid-base lg:mb-fluid-md"><div class="bg-thd-color-blue-90 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4xl max-w-screen-3xl md:mx-auto lg:thd-rounded-ext md:items-center px-fluid-base py-fluid-md lg:p-fluid-lg"><picture><source media="(max-width: 400px)" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pvn35iyy/production/3db8070fa00503ed3c7d63dfa3b3798ebd1e19d1-1298x1298.jpg?0=%26&amp;1=a&amp;2=u&amp;3=t&amp;4=o&amp;5=%3D&amp;6=f&amp;7=o&amp;8=r&amp;9=m&amp;10=a&amp;11=t&amp;12=%26&amp;13=d&amp;14=p&amp;15=r&amp;16=%3D&amp;17=1 1x, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pvn35iyy/production/3db8070fa00503ed3c7d63dfa3b3798ebd1e19d1-1298x1298.jpg?0=%26&amp;1=a&amp;2=u&amp;3=t&amp;4=o&amp;5=%3D&amp;6=f&amp;7=o&amp;8=r&amp;9=m&amp;10=a&amp;11=t&amp;12=%26&amp;13=d&amp;14=p&amp;15=r&amp;16=%3D&amp;17=2 2x" type="image/webp"><source media="(max-width: 400px)" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pvn35iyy/production/3db8070fa00503ed3c7d63dfa3b3798ebd1e19d1-1298x1298.jpg?0=%26&amp;1=d&amp;2=p&amp;3=r&amp;4=%3D&amp;5=1, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pvn35iyy/production/3db8070fa00503ed3c7d63dfa3b3798ebd1e19d1-1298x1298.jpg?0=%26&amp;1=d&amp;2=p&amp;3=r&amp;4=%3D&amp;5=2"><source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pvn35iyy/production/3db8070fa00503ed3c7d63dfa3b3798ebd1e19d1-1298x1298.jpg?0=%26&amp;1=a&amp;2=u&amp;3=t&amp;4=o&amp;5=%3D&amp;6=f&amp;7=o&amp;8=r&amp;9=m&amp;10=a&amp;11=t&amp;12=%26&amp;13=d&amp;14=p&amp;15=r&amp;16=%3D&amp;17=1 1x, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pvn35iyy/production/3db8070fa00503ed3c7d63dfa3b3798ebd1e19d1-1298x1298.jpg?0=%26&amp;1=a&amp;2=u&amp;3=t&amp;4=o&amp;5=%3D&amp;6=f&amp;7=o&amp;8=r&amp;9=m&amp;10=a&amp;11=t&amp;12=%26&amp;13=d&amp;14=p&amp;15=r&amp;16=%3D&amp;17=2 2x" type="image/webp"><source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pvn35iyy/production/3db8070fa00503ed3c7d63dfa3b3798ebd1e19d1-1298x1298.jpg?0=%26&amp;1=d&amp;2=p&amp;3